            mc "Alright alright."
            play sound sfx_cloth_rustling1
            scene sm1cs-vs003-23 mc-vs-tl-talk2_c1 with dissolve
            play voice3 girl33_arrogant_laugh noloop
            vs "Sorry. I was just channeling my inner Denise."
