            play voice3 girl33_happy_wooh noloop
            vs "That's the spirit."
            vs "We're really close, [mcname]. I can feel it in my tummy."
            scene sm1cs-vs003-25 mc-vs-tl-talk_c2 with dissolve
            play voice2 mc_happy_laugh2 noloop
            mc "*chuckles* Alright."
